here entire pages or portions of pages are not relevant, omit those pages, or portions of pages as not relevant. | 285 pages | Source: Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 17:35:54 +0000</pubDate><guid>documentcloud-28519353</guid><category>court_filing</category></item><item><title>[527] Anthony Mays Petition-Certificate Innocence Granted</title><link>https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/28519340-anthony-mays-petition-certificate-innocence-granted</link><description>45 pages</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 17:31:45 +0000</pubDate><guid>documentcloud-28519340</guid><category>court_filing</category></item><item><title>[38956] 2026-07 - 2A-2023-40236 - Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada</title><link>https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/28519265-2026-07-2a-2023-40236-immigration-refugees-and-citizenship-canada</link><description>For the period of October 6th, 2023 until January 9th, 2024 we are requesting the final versions of formal corporate records (ie. memoranda, briefing documents and reports) ADM level and above created by the three following sectors; International Crisis Response, Communications and Strategic Policy relating to the evacuation effort of Canadians from Gaza and the discussions within IRCC on the immigration measures aka temporary resident pathway. Please exclude E-mails, Cabinet Confidences and/or consultations with DOJ, draft documents and provide only the final versions and where entire pages or portions of pages are not relevant to the request, omit those pages or portions of pages as not relevant. | 161 pages | Source: Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 17:09:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>documentcloud-28519265</guid><category>court_filing</category></item><item><title>[125] 7-22-26 MR213551</title><link>https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/28518529-7-22-26-mr213551</link><description>Delaware Supreme Court, Delaware | 2 pages | 